- Cash on hand, current runway (by approach: reported burn vs. forecasted committed spend)
- Last quarter revenue and monthly run-rate
- Monthly net cash burn (last 3–12 months trend)
- Forecasted 12‑month cash flow (best / base / downside scenarios)
- Key drivers: hiring plan, capex, inventory, AR days
- Action plan and timing (fundraising timeline if applicable)

