- Current liquidity: $2.1M cash.
- Revenue momentum: $2.4M last quarter (avg $800K/month).
- Burn: reported net burn $62K/month (if using net burn → runway ≈ 34 months). If using plan-based assumptions runway = 14 months — reconcile definitions.
