- Balance and runway: Cash on hand is $2.1M. Using our trailing 3‑month average net cash burn of $62K/month, the company would have ~34 months of runway. The currently circulated 14‑month runway number uses an adjusted projection that (a) includes committed near-term spend of $X (hires, capex), (b) assumes a deterioration in collections or revenue of Y%, and (c) treats $Z of cash as restricted — items we are reconciling.  
