- Action plan: (1) Reconcile the runway discrepancy and publish a single standard (definition + period) for runway; (2) Produce a rolling 12-month cashflow forecast with weekly updates and scenario sensitivity (base/downside/upside); (3) Identify cost-savings or delayable spend to extend runway by X months if downside revenue occurs; (4) Prepare investor/funding materials if downside scenario reduces runway below target threshold.

