- Note on runway assumptions: an alternative internal projection showing 14 months of runway reflects a higher net cash burn (≈$150K/month). That scenario assumes incremental spending or conservatively excludes certain revenue streams/collections — please confirm which assumptions you want reflected in external and internal communications. We recommend presenting both the baseline and the conservative scenario in internal materials so stakeholders understand the sensitivity.

